                                                "example_id": "dfb045a9-43f4-4cfa-881e-7f5026ffa02c",
                                                "sense_id": "451b3df5-cc0d-36e8-b732-1b2f78bef402",
                                                "text": "... the Scythians came and on the site of present-day Simferopol stood their capital, Neapolis, repeatedly mentioned by ancient writers. Neapolis reached its apogee in the 2nd century BC during the reign of King Skilur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
